---
// IndividualPageModals.astro
// Replaces the single tabbed window with individual dedicated popups.
---

<!-- 1. OUR MISSION MODAL -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-page-mission">
  <div class="fullscreen-mac-window">
    <div class="fullscreen-window-header">
      <div class="window-title-meta">Our Mission</div>
      <div class="fullscreen-window-controls">
        <span class="dot-btn dot-red close-modal-btn" data-close-target="modal-page-mission"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fullscreen-window-body">
      <div class="mission-full-content">
        <div class="mission-text-column">
          <h1 class="mission-main-title">
            We find the 1% your <br />
            market is waiting for.
          </h1>
          <p class="mission-lead-p">
            Most brands spread effort across everything. We find the one thing that changes the economics.
          </p>
          <p class="mission-secondary-p">
            One buyer insight. One positioning shift. One structural fix. Then we build the system that makes it compound.
          </p>
          <div class="in-practice-section">
            <span class="practice-badge">In Practice</span>
            <ul class="practice-bullets">
              <li><span class="bullet-cup-icon">☕</span><span>Every engagement starts with one question: who is actually buying, and why?</span></li>
              <li><span class="bullet-cup-icon">☕</span><span>Every engagement produces one Thinking Document.</span></li>
              <li><span class="bullet-cup-icon">☕</span><span>Every engagement agrees on one metric before work begins.</span></li>
              <li><span class="bullet-cup-icon">☕</span><span>Every engagement is measured by whether that number moves.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="watermark-column">
          <div class="glowing-bulb-container">
            <div class="bulb-glow"></div>
            <span class="bulb-icon">💡</span>
          </div>
          <div class="watermark-typography">
            <span>Creative</span> <br />
            <span>Intelligence for</span> <br />
            <span>Measurable Market</span> <br />
            <span>Power.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 2. CUP CASES MODAL (Dual View: Grid + Tabbed Detail) -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-page-cases">
  <div class="fullscreen-mac-window">
    <div class="fullscreen-window-header">
      <div class="window-title-meta">Cup Cases</div>
      <div class="fullscreen-window-controls">
        <span class="dot-btn dot-red close-modal-btn" data-close-target="modal-page-cases"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VIEW A: Document Icon Grid (MacBook Air - 11) -->
    <div class="fullscreen-window-body cases-grid-body" id="cases-view-grid">
      <div class="cases-document-grid">
        <div class="case-doc-item" data-case-id="fctrylab">
          <div class="case-doc-icon">
            <svg width="48" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="34" y2="20" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="28" x2="34" y2="28" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="36" x2="26" y2="36" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="case-doc-label">FCTRYLAB</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-doc-item" data-case-id="fabindia">
          <div class="case-doc-icon">
            <svg width="48" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="34" y2="20" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="28" x2="34" y2="28" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="36" x2="26" y2="36" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="case-doc-label">FabIndia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-doc-item" data-case-id="godrej-interio">
          <div class="case-doc-icon">
            <svg width="48" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="34" y2="20" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="28" x2="34" y2="28" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="36" x2="26" y2="36" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="case-doc-label">Godrej Interio</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-doc-item" data-case-id="godrej-properties">
          <div class="case-doc-icon">
            <svg width="48" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="34" y2="20" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="28" x2="34" y2="28" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="36" x2="26" y2="36" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="case-doc-label">Godrej Properties</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-doc-item" data-case-id="reverb-asia">
          <div class="case-doc-icon">
            <svg width="48" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="34" y2="20" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="28" x2="34" y2="28" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="36" x2="26" y2="36" stroke="#B8AE9C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="case-doc-label">Reverb Asia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VIEW B: Tabbed Case Study Detail (MacBook Air - 12) -->
    <div class="cases-detail-view" id="cases-view-detail" style="display:none;">
      <!-- Sub-tab bar -->
      <div class="cs-subtab-bar">
        <button class="cs-back-btn" id="cs-back-to-grid" title="Back to all cases">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="cs-subtab" data-case-tab="fctrylab">FCTRYLAB</button>
        <button class="cs-subtab" data-case-tab="fabindia">FabIndia <span class="subtab-close">×</span></button>
        <button class="cs-subtab" data-case-tab="godrej-interio">Godrej Interio</button>
        <button class="cs-subtab" data-case-tab="godrej-properties">Godrej Properties</button>
        <button class="cs-subtab" data-case-tab="reverb-asia">Reverb Asia</button>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-detail-layout">
        <!-- Left Sidebar -->
        <div class="cs-sidebar">
          <div class="cs-sidebar-item" data-case-tab="fctrylab">FCTRYLAB</div>
          <div class="cs-sidebar-item" data-case-tab="fabindia">FabIndia</div>
          <div class="cs-sidebar-item" data-case-tab="godrej-interio">Godrej Interio</div>
          <div class="cs-sidebar-item" data-case-tab="godrej-properties">Godrej Properties</div>
          <div class="cs-sidebar-item" data-case-tab="reverb-asia">Reverb Asia</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content Area (scrollable) -->
        <div class="cs-main-content">
          <!-- FCTRYLAB -->
          <div class="cs-pane" id="cs-pane-fctrylab">
            <span class="cs-category-label">Tech / Manufacturing</span>
            <div class="cs-brand-name">FCTRYLAB</div>
            <h1 class="cs-headline">Building Factory Intelligence</h1>
            <div class="cs-cards-grid">
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>The Challenge Question</h4><p>How do you predict equipment failures before they happen? Not reactive maintenance. Predictive intelligence.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Found</h4><p>Sensor data existed across 14 separate dashboards with no unified alerting threshold. Teams relied on intuition rather than data patterns.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Built</h4><p>A unified IoT intelligence layer aggregating real-time sensor feeds with ML-driven anomaly detection and automated maintenance scheduling.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-stat-block"><h4>WHAT MOVED</h4><div class="cs-big-number">62%</div><p>reduction in unplanned downtime. $2.1M annual savings. Zero critical equipment failures in Q3-Q4.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FabIndia -->
          <div class="cs-pane" id="cs-pane-fabindia">
            <span class="cs-category-label">Retail and Lifestyle / India</span>
            <div class="cs-brand-name">FabIndia</div>
            <h1 class="cs-headline">Connecting Marketing to Revenue</h1>
            <div class="cs-cards-grid">
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>The Challenge Question</h4><p>How do we know marketing is actually driving sales? Not just metrics. Not dashboards. Real revenue attribution.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Found</h4><p>A missing measurement layer. Digital spend and in-store footfall existed in entirely separate worlds. Acquisition cost was artificially high because nobody had connected digital touchpoints to store walk-ins.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Built</h4><p>Mapped offline leads manually. Tracked where every lead originated. Connected store visits to purchases. Ran daily feedback loops to adjust campaigns in real time.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-stat-block"><h4>WHAT MOVED</h4><div class="cs-big-number">43%</div><p>reduction in offline purchase cost. 30% improvement in ROAS. Budget unchanged. Outcomes different.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Godrej Interio -->
          <div class="cs-pane" id="cs-pane-godrej-interio">
            <span class="cs-category-label">Furniture / India</span>
            <div class="cs-brand-name">Godrej Interio</div>
            <h1 class="cs-headline">Redesigning the Purchase Journey</h1>
            <div class="cs-cards-grid">
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>The Challenge Question</h4><p>Why are high-intent visitors dropping off before reaching showrooms? Furniture is a tactile purchase — what's breaking the bridge?</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Found</h4><p>The digital experience ended at product listing. No room visualizer. No appointment flow. No post-visit follow-up. The journey had a cliff, not a funnel.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Built</h4><p>End-to-end digital showroom experience with 3D configurator, appointment booking, and post-visit nurture sequences tied to CRM.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-stat-block"><h4>WHAT MOVED</h4><div class="cs-big-number">3.8x</div><p>showroom visit-to-purchase conversion. 28% increase in average order value through bundled room solutions.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Godrej Properties -->
          <div class="cs-pane" id="cs-pane-godrej-properties">
            <span class="cs-category-label">Real Estate / India</span>
            <div class="cs-brand-name">Godrej Properties</div>
            <h1 class="cs-headline">Digital-First Property Sales</h1>
            <div class="cs-cards-grid">
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>The Challenge Question</h4><p>Can you sell a ₹2 Cr apartment without a single site visit? Not just generate leads — close actual transactions digitally.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Found</h4><p>The sales team was spending 80% of time on unqualified leads. Digital channels drove volume but not intent quality. No lead scoring existed.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Built</h4><p>Virtual walkthrough platform with integrated payment booking. AI-powered lead scoring prioritizing high-intent buyers. Automated sales pipeline with real-time dashboards.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-stat-block"><h4>WHAT MOVED</h4><div class="cs-big-number">156</div><p>units sold digitally in 72 hours during launch. ₹312 Cr revenue from digital-first campaign. 4x reduction in cost per acquisition.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Reverb Asia -->
          <div class="cs-pane" id="cs-pane-reverb-asia">
            <span class="cs-category-label">Music / APAC</span>
            <div class="cs-brand-name">Reverb Asia</div>
            <h1 class="cs-headline">Scaling Artist Marketplaces</h1>
            <div class="cs-cards-grid">
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>The Challenge Question</h4><p>How do you build trust in a peer-to-peer marketplace where buyers can't touch the instruments? The APAC market had zero reference point.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Found</h4><p>Sellers had instruments but no photography skills. Buyers had intent but no confidence. The trust gap was visual, not transactional.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-info-card"><h4>What We Built</h4><p>Seller onboarding toolkit with guided photo capture. Buyer confidence system with verified seller badges, condition grading, and return guarantees.</p></div>
              <div class="cs-stat-block"><h4>WHAT MOVED</h4><div class="cs-big-number">8x</div><p>GMV growth in 6 months. Seller listing completion rate from 23% to 89%. Buyer repeat purchase rate at 34%.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 3. CUP FRAMEWORK MODAL -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-page-framework">
  <div class="fullscreen-mac-window">
    <div class="fullscreen-window-header">
      <div class="window-title-meta">Cup Framework</div>
      <div class="fullscreen-window-controls">
