              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <text x="50%" y="60%" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="22" font-weight="500" fill="#B8AE9C" text-anchor="middle">U</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="fw-nav-label">Uncommon Ideas</span>
        </div>

        <!-- P -->
        <div class="fw-nav-item" data-fw-target="power">
          <div class="fw-nav-icon">
            <svg width="40" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 0H32L44 12V52C44 54.2091 42.2091 56 40 56H4C1.79086 56 0 54.2091 0 52V4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0Z" fill="#EFE8DA"/>
              <path d="M32 0L44 12H36C33.7909 12 32 10.2091 32 8V0Z" fill="#DDD5C3"/>
              <text x="50%" y="60%" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="22" font-weight="500" fill="#B8AE9C" text-anchor="middle">P</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="fw-nav-label">Power In Market</span>
        </div>
      </div>


      <!-- Pop-over Cards -->
      <!-- Clarity (C) -->
      <div class="fw-popover-card" id="fw-popover-clarity">
        <div class="fw-popover-arrow"></div>
        <div class="fw-popover-header">
          <h3>Clarity</h3>
          <span class="fw-pop-close">×</span>
        </div>
        <p class="fw-pop-sub">Defining the exact position you hold in the market</p>
        <div class="fw-pop-body">
          <p>Most brands are built on assumptions. <span class="fw-highlight">They lack clear positioning.</span></p>
          <p>We find the whitespace. We define what you stand for, who you're for, and why they should care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fw-pop-list-box">
          <span class="fw-pop-list-title">What we do here</span>
          <ul class="fw-pop-list">
            <li>☕ Brand Architecture</li>
            <li>☕ Value Proposition Design</li>
            <li>☕ Audience Segmentation</li>
            <li>☕ Core Narrative Development</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <button class="fw-pop-btn">Let's Find Clarity</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Uncommon Ideas (U) -->
      <div class="fw-popover-card" id="fw-popover-uncommon">
        <div class="fw-popover-arrow"></div>
        <div class="fw-popover-header">
          <h3>Uncommon Ideas</h3>
          <span class="fw-pop-close">×</span>
        </div>
        <p class="fw-pop-sub">Understanding markets before influencing them</p>
        <div class="fw-pop-body">
          <p>Most growth problems are not marketing problems. <span class="fw-highlight">They are clarity problems.</span></p>
          <p>Wrong message. Right buyer. Right message. Wrong channel. We remove that ambiguity before touching a single campaign. You cannot influence a market you do not understand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fw-pop-list-box">
          <span class="fw-pop-list-title">What we do here</span>
          <ul class="fw-pop-list">
            <li>☕ Buyer behaviour analysis</li>
            <li>☕ Market and category mapping</li>
            <li>☕ Demand signal analysis</li>
            <li>☕ Competitor narrative analysis</li>
            <li>☕ Cultural and behavioural insights</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <button class="fw-pop-btn">Let's Unlock Ideas</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Power (P) -->
      <div class="fw-popover-card" id="fw-popover-power">
        <div class="fw-popover-arrow"></div>
        <div class="fw-popover-header">
          <h3>Power In Market</h3>
          <span class="fw-pop-close">×</span>
        </div>
        <p class="fw-pop-sub">Converting attention into measurable dominance</p>
        <div class="fw-pop-body">
          <p>Awareness is not power. <span class="fw-highlight">Conversion is power.</span></p>
          <p>We design the systems that capture demand, convert it efficiently, and compound it over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fw-pop-list-box">
          <span class="fw-pop-list-title">What we do here</span>
          <ul class="fw-pop-list">
            <li>☕ Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)</li>
            <li>☕ Growth Loop Architecture</li>
            <li>☕ Lifecycle Marketing</li>
