      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-page-capabilities">
  <div class="fullscreen-mac-window">
    <div class="fullscreen-window-header">
      <div class="window-title-meta">Core Capabilities</div>
      <div class="fullscreen-window-controls">
        <span class="dot-btn dot-red close-modal-btn" data-close-target="modal-page-capabilities"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fullscreen-window-body default-padded-body">
      <h2 class="pane-title">Core Capabilities</h2>
      <div class="pane-cap-grid">
        <div class="pcap-card"><span class="pcap-emoji">🎯</span><h3>Brand Positioning</h3><p>Disruptive messaging architectures designed to win top-tier markets.</p></div>
        <div class="pcap-card"><span class="pcap-emoji">⚡</span><h3>Digital Experience</h3><p>State-of-the-art web apps, interactive OS interfaces, and dynamic UX.</p></div>
        <div class="pcap-card"><span class="pcap-emoji">📊</span><h3>Growth Engineering</h3><p>Data-driven acquisition engines built for long-term scalability.</p></div>
        <div class="pcap-card"><span class="pcap-emoji">💎</span><h3>Creative Direction</h3><p>World-class visual aesthetics, motion design, and brand identity systems.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 5. ABOUT US MODAL -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-page-about">
  <div class="fullscreen-mac-window">
    <div class="fullscreen-window-header">
      <div class="window-title-meta">About Us</div>
      <div class="fullscreen-window-controls">
        <span class="dot-btn dot-red close-modal-btn" data-close-target="modal-page-about"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
        <span class="dot-btn dot-cream"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fullscreen-window-body default-padded-body">
